---
---
<section class="hero">
	<div class="hero-bg"></div>
	<div class="container hero-content">
		<h1>
			<span class="sub-title">渋谷の「空」を感じる、静謐な空間</span>
			<span class="main-title">渋空 <span class="en">Shibusora</span></span>
		</h1>
		<p class="description">
			渋谷区東の閑静なエリアに位置する、レンタルスペース「渋空」。<br />
			会議、ワークショップ、撮影など、多彩なシーンにご利用いただけます。
		</p>
		<div class="hero-actions">
			<a href="#access" class="btn-outline">Access</a>
			<a href="#" class="btn-primary">Reserve Now</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hero {
		height: 80vh;
		min-height: 500px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: #f0f4f8;
	}
	.hero-bg {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f2fe 0%, #bae6fd 50%, #7dd3fc 100%);
		opacity: 0.6;
		z-index: 0;
	}
	.hero-content {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
	}
	h1 {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	.sub-title {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
	}
	.main-title {
		font-size: 4.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}
	.main-title .en {
		font-size: 2rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		margin-left: 1rem;
		color: var(--accent);
		opacity: 0.8;
	}
	.description {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		max-width: 600px;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}
	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}
	.btn-primary {
		background: var(--text-main);
		color: #fff;
		padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-weight: 700;
		transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
	}
	.btn-outline {
		border: 1px solid var(--text-main);
		color: var(--text-main);
		padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-weight: 700;
		transition: background 0.2s;
	}
	.btn-primary:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		opacity: 0.9;
	}
	.btn-outline:hover {
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
	}
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.main-title {
			font-size: 3rem;
		}
		.main-title .en {
			display: block;
			margin-left: 0;
			margin-top: 0.5rem;
		}
		.hero-actions {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 1rem;
		}
		.btn-primary, .btn-outline {
			text-align: center;
		}
	}
</style>
